
### get all cats
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats

#### get cat by id
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### post new cat
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cat_id": 4,
    "name": "Mittens",
    "age": 2,
    "birthdate": "2021-05-15",
    "weight": 4.5,
    "owner": "Kimberly",
    "image": "https://placecats.com/300/200"
}
